step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the baseline mean combination on the full pool to see its performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if it improves over simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full model pool to see if it outperforms the current weighted inverse-error baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle (w1) on the full model pool to see if it outperforms the inverse_error weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean with 20% trimming on the full pool to see if robust trimming helps against outliers and correlated errors.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the full pool to see if iterative refinement improves over weighted inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on the smaller, more correlated pool1 to see if focusing on the top 5 models improves over the full pool weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on pool2 to see if a slightly larger pool improves over pool1 weighted results.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool1 using softmax_neg_error to see if different weighting improves over inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean on the smaller pool1 to see if reducing model count improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the slightly larger pool2 to see if reducing model count while keeping diversity improves over current weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted inverse_error combination on the larger pool3 to see if adding more models improves over current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

